OL,3,AWe're saving #100 a month for our kids
OL,4,Abut they won't get it until they're 57
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard and Caitlin Brain's two
OL,7,Fchildren are aged just 20 months and
OL,8,Ffive months respectively, yet mum and
OL,9,Fdad have already set up pensions for
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThe Brains, who live in Swansea, south
OL,13,FWales, are paying #50 a month into each
OL,14,Fof their kids' accounts. It's money
OL,15,Fthat the children won't be able to
OL,16,Faccess until they are 57, under current
OL,17,FUK private pension fund rules.
OL,19,FSo the eldest will have to wait until
OL,20,F2082, and the youngest until 2083.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
